**A1, settled already: no.** Only one decision covers these two rows, and it is the one that orders the work: PD221(d), `docs/d1-loop12-17-split-plan.md:1885`. The previous prior-art round for L2-A3 checked this and returned `novel` (`archive/peer/2026-09-27-priorart-c108b-l2a3.md:494`). The addendum does not change the direction, only how row 2 is routed.

