One small note: the addendum places the `STEPX diff 0` evidence at `:24-38`. In the log I read, the gate summary sits at `:39`. Both point to the same place, so this is not a contradiction.

**A4, unread evidence: none.** The addendum cites the earlier review's discriminating test and its "What was done with it" note (`archive/peer/2026-09-27-priorart-c108b-l2a3.md:522-528`). That note says the scratch check was "judgement's call". Card 108-4 has now made that check.

